  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys"><head>ΦΙΝΕΥΣ Α. Β.</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="633" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-633" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Apollonii Rhodii II, 178.</note>
            <quote>Ἐπηρώθη δὲ τὰς ὄψεις ὁ Φινεὺς κατὰ μὲν ἐνίους ὑπὸ τοῦ Ἡλίου, διὰ τὸ πολὺν χρόνον αἰτῆσαι μᾶλλον ζῆν, ἢ βλέπειν· κατὰ δὲ ἐνίους, ὅτι ἐπεβούλευσε Περσεῖ. Σοφοκλῆς δὲ, ὅτι τοὺς ἐκ Κλεοπάτρας υἱοὺς ἐτύφλωσεν Ὄαρθον καὶ Κράμβιν, πεισθεὶς διαβολαῖς Ἰδαίας τῆς αὐτῶν μητρυιᾶς.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Scholiasta Sophoclis ad Antig. 970, aliis nominibus Cleopatræ filios appellat.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="634" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-634" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:644">
            <note type="source">Aristophanes Pluto v. 635.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐξωμμάτωται καὶ λελάμπρυνται κόρας.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ubi scholiasta, Ἐκ Φινέως Σοφοκλέους ὁ στίχος.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="635" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-635" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:645">
            <note type="source">Pollux VII, 193.</note>
            <quote>Τὸ δὲ τῶν καπήλων ἐργαστήριον καπηλεῖον εἰρήκασιν οἱ κωμῳδοδιδάσκαλοι, καὶ τὸ κωμῳδούμενον ἐν Σοφοκλέους Φινεῖ</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Βλέφαρον κέκληταί γ᾽, ὡς καπηλείου θύραι.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="636" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-636" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:646">
            <note type="source">Athenæus III, p. 119 C.</note>
            <quote>Σοφοκλῆς τ᾽ ἐν Φινεῖ ἔφη</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Νεκρὸς τάριχος εἰσορᾶν Αἰγύπτιος.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="637" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-637" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:641">
            <note type="source">Stephanus,</note>
            <quote>Βόσπορος – Σοφοκλῆς δ᾽ ἐν Φινεῖ πρώτῳ διὰ διφθόγγου τὴν πρὸ τέλους φησὶ τὸ κύριον</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐδ᾽ ἂν τὸ Βοσπόρειον ἐν Σκύθαις ὕδωρ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="638" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-638" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:647">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀπενώτισαν· ἀπέστρεψαν τὰ νῶτα. Σ. Φινεί.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="639" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-639" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:643">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀρτύμασι· τοῖς πρὸς τὴν θυσίαν εὐτρεπιζομένοις. Σ. φιμεί.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Ita codex, ut dubitari possit utrum Φινεῖ α an β restituendum sit.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="640" xml:id="fragment-phineys-dindorf1893_grc1-640" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_phineys" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.phineys.nauck1889grc1:642">
            <note type="source">Hesychius,</note>
            <quote>Ἀχάλκευτα τρύπανα· τὰ Φρύγια πυρεῖα. Σ. Φινεῖ δευτέρῳ.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Codex φηνεὶ βω.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
